              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ejek 39.17-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ka dok aneno lamalaika mo ocuŋ i ceŋ. En olwoŋo kwa winyo ducu mapatpat ma gituk i dye yamo ki dwan maloŋo ni, “Wubin, wugurre kacel ka camo cam me otyeno ma Lubaŋa oyubo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka camo riŋo kom luker, ki riŋo kom ludito wi mony, ki riŋo kom jo ma yam gin oteka, riŋo aguragura ki riŋo kom jo ma ŋweco kwedgi, ki riŋo dano ducu, jo ma gilone kengi kacel ki opii, jo matino ki madito ducu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen aneno lee ca ki luker me lobo guywayo monygi me lweny i kom ŋat ma obedo i wi aguragura kacel ki monnye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.1+REV.13.2+REV.13.3+REV.13.4+REV.13.5+REV.13.6+REV.13.7+REV.13.8+REV.13.9+REV.13.10+REV.13.11+REV.13.12+REV.13.13+REV.13.14+REV.13.15+REV.13.16+REV.13.17+REV.13.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 13.1-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento gimako lee ca woko, kacel ki lanebi ma lagoba, ma yam obedo ka tiyo tic mogo me aura i nyime, ma obwolo dano ma onoŋo doŋ giketo poyo pa lee ca i komgi, ki ma yam onoŋo giworo calle-ni. Gin aryo-nu ducu, lee ki lanebi ma lagoba, gibologi woko makwo i nam me mac, ma tye ka lyel ki gweŋ calfa ma mac oliyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo mudoŋŋe ducu ginekogi woko ki pala lucwan pa ŋat ma obedo i wi aguragura matar-ri, ki pala lucan ma okatti ki i doge; winyo ducu guyeŋ woko ki riŋo kom dano ma gucamo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
